yszczanie przeszkleń oraz elewacji</h3><p>Stosując techniki linowe i podnośniki, jesteśmy w stanie umyć każdą powierzchnię - nawet taką w najbardziej niedostępnych miejscach. </p></div><div class=\"mt-5 md:mt-6\"><a href=\"/uslugi/mycie-przeszklen-i-elewacji\" class=\"focus-visible:ring-border-primary inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap ring-offset-white transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 border-0 text-text-primary gap-2 p-0 inline-flex items-center group\">Czytaj więcej<svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 15\" class=\"ml-2 transition-transform transform group-hover:translate-x-2\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M6.1584 3.13508C6.35985 2.94621 6.67627 2.95642 6.86514 3.15788L10.6151 7.15788C10.7954 7.3502 10.7954 7.64949 10.6151 7.84182L6.86514 11.8418C6.67627 12.0433 6.35985 12.0535 6.1584 11.8646C5.95694 11.6757 5.94673 11.3593 6.1356 11.1579L9.565 7.49985L6.1356 3.84182C5.94673 3.64036 5.95694 3.32394 6.1584 3.13508Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-start border-2 border-primary rounded-md p-6 md:p-8 \"><div><div class=\"rb-5 mb-5 md:mb-6\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" class=\"text-secondary\" height=\"30\" width=\"30\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M296 160H180.6l42.6-129.8C227.2 15 215.7 0 200 0H56C44 0 33.8 8.9 32.2 20.8l-32 240C-1.7 275.2 9.5 288 24 288h118.7L96.6 482.5c-3.6 15.2 8 29.5 23.3 29.5 8.4 0 16.4-4.4 20.8-12l176-304c9.3-15.9-2.2-36-20.7-36z\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"text-primary  text-2xl font-bold md:text-3xl md:leading-[1.3] lg:text-4xl\">Naprawa uszkodzeń po ptakach</h2><h3 class=\"text-xl  mb-3 md:mb-4\">Naprawa dziur w elewacji i kratek wentylacyjnych </h3><p>Pęknięcia i dziury w elewacji tynkowej, często spowodowane przez ptaki, wymagają szybkiej naprawy, aby uniknąć dalszych uszkodzeń. </p></div><div class=\"mt-5 md:mt-6\"><a href=\"/uslugi/naprawa-uszkodzen-po-ptakach\" class=\"focus-visible:ring-border-primary inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap ring-offset-white transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 border-0 text-text-primary gap-2 p-0 inline-flex items-center group\">Czytaj więcej<svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 15\" class=\"ml-2 transition-transform transform group-hover:translate-x-2\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M6.1584 3.13508C6.35985 2.94621 6.67627 2.95642 6.86514 3.15788L10.6151 7.15788C10.7954 7.3502 10.7954 7.64949 10.6151 7.84182L6.86514 11.8418C6.67627 12.0433 6.35985 12.0535 6.1584 11.8646C5.95694 11.6757 5.94673 11.3593 6.1356 11.1579L9.565 7.49985L6.1356 3.84182C5.94673 3.64036 5.95694 3.32394 6.1584 3.13508Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-start border-2 border-primary rounded-md p-6 md:p-8 \"><div><div class=\"rb-5 mb-5 md:mb-6\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" class=\"text-secondary\" height=\"30\" width=\"30\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M507.73 109.1c-2.24-9.03-13.54-12.09-20.12-5.51l-74.36 74.36-67.88-11.31-11.31-67.88 74.36-74.36c6.62-6.62 3.43-17.9-5.66-20.16-47.38-11.74-99.55.91-136.58 37.93-39.64 39.64-50.55 97.1-34.05 147.2L18.74 402.76c-24.99 24.99-24.99 65.51 0 90.5 24.99 24.99 65.51 24.99 90.5 0l213.21-213.21c50.12 16.71 107.47 5.68 147.37-34.22 37.07-37.07 49.7-89.32 37.91-136.73zM64 472c-13.25 0-24-10.75-24-24 0-13.26 10.75-24 24-24s24 10.74 24 24c0 13.25-10.75 24-24 24z\"></pa