7.1894 30.125 69.0076 30.8 70.75 31.7C71.1667 31.8875 71.4795 32.1687 71.6886 32.5437C71.8962 32.9187 72 33.3125 72 33.725V60.8375C72 61.7 71.6311 62.3563 70.8932 62.8062C70.1538 63.2562 69.3864 63.275 68.5909 62.8625C67.1894 62.1125 65.7212 61.5312 64.1864 61.1187C62.653 60.7062 61.0909 60.5 59.5 60.5C57.2273 60.5 55.0303 60.8937 52.9091 61.6812C50.7879 62.4688 48.8182 63.575 47 65Z\" fill=\"white\"></path> </svg> <p> Stawiamy na naukę w małych grupach, indywidualne podejście do każdego słuchacza, co wspiera skuteczność nauczania i poprawia komfort współpracy na linii słuchacz – lektor. </p> </div> <div class=\"why-us-grid__element\" data-sal=\"slide-up\" data-sal-delay=\"100\" data-sal-duration=\"750\"> <svg width=\"94\" height=\"94\" viewbox=\"0 0 94 94\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <circle cx=\"47\" cy=\"47\" r=\"47\" fill=\"#04315B\"></circle> <path d=\"M66 45.3C66 44.3983 65.6456 43.5335 65.0148 42.8958C64.384 42.2582 63.5285 41.9 62.6364 41.9H52.0073L53.6218 34.131C53.6555 33.961 53.6723 33.774 53.6723 33.587C53.6723 32.89 53.3864 32.244 52.9323 31.785L51.1495 30L40.0832 41.186C39.4609 41.815 39.0909 42.665 39.0909 43.6V60.6C39.0909 61.5017 39.4453 62.3665 40.0761 63.0042C40.7069 63.6418 41.5625 64 42.4545 64H57.5909C58.9868 64 60.1809 63.15 60.6855 61.926L65.7645 49.941C65.9159 49.55 66 49.142 66 48.7V45.3ZM29 64H35.7273V43.6H29V64Z\" fill=\"white\"></path> </svg> <p> Z dużą starannością dobieramy lektorów do naszego zespołu. Tworzymy zespół odpowiednio wykwalifikowanych, doświadczonych, życzliwych i kreatywnych ludzi, pełnych uśmiechu i energii, którzy stale rozwijają swoje umiejętności w nauczaniu języka. </p> </div> <div class=\"why-us-grid__element\" data-sal=\"slide-up\" data-sal-delay=\"100\" data-sal-duration=\"750\"> <svg width=\"94\" height=\"94\" viewbox=\"0 0 94 94\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <circle cx=\"47\" cy=\"47\" r=\"47\" fill=\"#04315B\"></circle> <path d=\"M67 62H55.2857V27H67V62ZM52.3571 62H40.6429V37.7692H52.3571V62ZM37.7143 62H26V45.8462H37.7143V62Z\" fill=\"white\"></path> </svg> <p> W naszej szkole stawiamy na skuteczność. Tradycyjne i sprawdzone metody nauczania języka angielskiego wzbogacamy o elementy nowatorskich programów autorskich, z dużym naciskiem na komunikację i budowanie relacji z uczniem. </p> </div> <div class=\"why-us-grid__element\" data-sal=\"slide-up\" data-sal-delay=\"100\" data-sal-duration=\"750\"> <svg width=\"94\" height=\"94\" viewbox=\"0 0 94 94\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <circle cx=\"47\" cy=\"47\" r=\"47\" fill=\"#D10C15\"></circle> <path d=\"M55.3158 40.8182V35.6364H50.1053V32.1818H55.3158V27H58.7895V32.1818H64V35.6364H58.7895V40.8182H55.3158ZM44.8947 47.7273C45.85 47.7273 46.6681 47.3887 47.3489 46.7116C48.0286 46.0357 48.3684 45.2227 48.3684 44.2727C48.3684 43.3227 48.0286 42.5092 47.3489 41.8321C46.6681 41.1562 45.85 40.8182 44.8947 40.8182C43.9395 40.8182 43.122 41.1562 42.4423 41.8321C41.7615 42.5092 41.4211 43.3227 41.4211 44.2727C41.4211 45.2227 41.7615 46.0357 42.4423 46.7116C43.122 47.3887 43.9395 47.7273 44.8947 47.7273ZM44.8947 65C40.2342 61.0561 36.7536 57.3925 34.4528 54.0094C32.1509 50.6274 31 47.497 31 44.6182C31 40.3 32.397 36.8598 35.191 34.2977C37.9838 31.7356 41.2184 30.4545 44.8947 30.4545C45.4737 30.4545 46.0526 30.4902 46.6316 30.5616C47.2105 30.6342 47.7895 30.7424 48.3684 30.8864V37.3636H53.5789V42.5455H58.6592C58.7171 42.8909 58.7536 43.2364 58.7686 43.5818C58.7825 43.9273 58.7895 44.2727 58.7895 44.6182C58.7895 47.497 57.6391 50.6274 55.3384 54.0094C53.0365 57.3925 49.5553 61.0561 44.8947 65Z\" fill=\"white\"></path> </svg> <p> Nasze placówki są zlokalizowane w bardzo bliskiej odległości od lokalnych szkół. Gwarantuje to szybki i bezpieczny dostęp do naszych placówek, znajdujących się w lokalnym, znanym środowisku. </p> </div> <div class=\"why-us-grid__element\" data-sal=\"slide-up\" data-sal-delay=\"100\" data-sal-duration=\"750\"> <svg width=\"94\" height=\"94\" viewbox=\"0 0 94 94\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <circle cx=\"47\" cy=\"47\" r=\"47\" fill=\"#FFCC02\"></circle> <path d=\"M49.25 47.8062L53.1875 51.7437C53.5083 52.0646 53.6687 52.4659 53.6687 52.9478C53.6687 53.4284 53.5083 53.8438 53.1875 54.1938C52.8375 54.5437 52.4222 54.7188 51.9415 54.7188C51.4597 54.7188 51.0437 54.5437 50.6938 54.1938L46.975 50.475C46.5667 50.0667 46.2604 49.6146 46.0562 49.1187C45.8521 48.6229 45.75 48.0833 45.75 47.5V42.25C45.75 41.7542 45.918 41.3382 46.254 41.0022C46.5888 40.6674 47.0042 40.5 47.5 40.5C47.9958 40.5 48.4118 40.6674 48.7478 41.0022C49.0826 41.3382 49.25 41.7542 49.25 42.25V47.8062ZM47.5 33.5C47.9958 33.5 48.4118 33.6674 48.7478 34.0023C49.0826 34.3383 49.25 34.7542 49.25 35.25C49.25 35.7458 49.0826 36.1617 48.7478 36.4977C48.4118 36.8326 47.9958 37 47.5 37C47.0042 37 46.5888 36.8326 46.254 36.4977C45.918 36.1617 45.75 35.7458 45.75 35.25C45.75 34.7542 45.918 34.3383 46.254 34.0023C46.5888 33.6674 47.0042 33.5 47.5 33.5ZM61.5 47.5C61.5 47.9958 61.332 48.4112 60.996 48.746C60.6612 49.082 60.2458 49.25 59.75 49.25C59.2542 49.25 58.8388 49.082 58.504 48.746C58.168 48.4112 58 47.9958 58 47.5C58 47.0042 58.168 46.5882 58.504 46.2522C58.8388 45.9174 59.2542 45.75 59.75 45.75C60.2458 45.75 60.6612 45.9174 60.996 46.2522C61.332 46.5882 61.5 47.0042 61.5 47.5ZM47.5 58C47.9958 58 48.4118 58.168 48.7478 58.504C49.0826 58.8388 49.25 59.2542 49.25 59.75C49.25 60.2458 49.0826 60.6612 48.7478 60.996C48.4118 61.332 47.9958 61.5 47.5 61.5C47.0042 61.5 46.5888 61.332 46.254 60.996C45.918 60.6612 45.75 60.2458 45.75 59.75C45.75 59.2542 45.918 58.8388 46.254 58.504C46.5888 58.168 47.0042 58 47.5 58ZM37 47.5C37 47.9958 36.8326 48.4112 36.4977 48.746C36.1617 49.082 35.7458 49.25 35.25 49.25C34.7542 49.25 34.3383 49.082 34.0023 48.746C33.6674 48.4112 33.5 47.9958 33.5 47.5C33.5 47.0042 33.6674 46.5882 34.0023 46.2522C34.3383 45.9174 34.7542 45.75 35.25 45.75C35.7458 45.75 36.1617 45.9174 36.4977 46.2522C36.8326 46.5882 37 47.0042 37 47.5ZM47.5 65C45.0792 65 42.8042 64.5403 40.675 63.621C38.5458 62.7028 36.6938 61.4563 35.1188 59.8813C33.5438 58.3063 32.2972 56.4542 31.379 54.325C30.4597 52.1958 30 49.9208 30 47.5C30 45.0792 30.4597 42.8042 31.379 40.675C32.2972 38.5458 33.5438 36.6938 35.1188 35.1188C36.6938 33.5438 38.5458 32.2966 40.675 31.3772C42.8042 30.4591 45.0792 30 47.5 30C49.9208 30 52.1958 30.4591 54.325 31.3772C56.4542 32.2966 58.3063 33.5438 59.8813 35.1188C61.4563 36.6938 62.7028 38.5458 63.621 40.675C64.5403 42.8042 65 45.0792 65 47.5C65 49.9208 64.5403 52.1958 63.621 54.325C62.7028 56.4542 61.4563 58.3063 59.8813 59.8813C58.3063 61.4563 56.4542 62.7028 54.325 63.621C52.1958 64.5403 49.9208 65 47.5 65ZM47.5 61.5C51.4083 61.5 54.7187 60.1437 57.4312 57.4312C60.1437 54.7187 61.5 51.4083 61.5 47.5C61.5 43.5917 60.1437 40.2812 57.4312 37.5687C54.7187 34.8562 51.4083 33.5 47.5 33.5C43.5917 33.5 40.2812 34.8562 37.5687 37.5687C34.8562 40.2812 33.5 43.5917 33.5 47.5C33.5 51.4083 34.8562 54.7187 37.5687 57.4312C40.2812 60.1437 43.5917 61.5 47.5 61.5Z\" fill=\"white\"></path> </svg> <p> Szanujemy czas naszych uczniów i ich rodziców. Uwzględniamy preferencje słuchaczy, elastycznie dopasowując rozkład naszych zajęć do ich potrzeb. </p> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class=\"quote\" id=\"\'quote\"> <div class=\"quote__container\"> <div class=\"active quote__wrapper\"> <blockquote> \"The borders of my language are the borders of my world\" </blockquote> <p>~Ludwig Wittgenstein</p> </div> <div class=\"quote__wrapper\"> <blockquote> \"A different language is a different vision of life\" </blockquote> <p>~Frederico Fellini</p> </div> <div class=\"quote__wrapper\"> <blockquote>\"With languages, you are at home anywhere\"</blockquote> <p>~Edmund de Waal</p> </div> <div class=\"quote__svg\"> <img src=\"pathred.c02536f3.png\" alt> </div> </div> </section> <section class=\"about\" id=\"about\"> <div class=\"about__container container\"> <div class=\"about__left\" data-sal=\"slide-up\" data-sal-delay=\"100\" data-sal-duration=\"750\"> <h2>nasz team!</h2> <p> Nasz zespół to młodzi, dobrze wykwalifikowani lektorzy, którzy potrafią dostosować się do potrzeb współczesnego ucznia. Komunikacja między lektorem, uczniem i rodzicem jest dla nas kluczowa w całym procesie nauczania, tak aby każdy mógł czerpać z tego procesu korzyści i satysfakcję. Dokładamy wszelkich starań, aby nasi lektorzy czuli się dobrze w swojej pracy, a dzięki współpracy z metodykiem mogli szybko i skutecznie rozwiązać napotkane problemy. Wiemy, że przyjazna atmosfera w zespole przekłada się na komfortową pracę z uczniem. </p> </div> <div class=\"about__right\" data-sal=\"slide-up\" data-sal-delay=\"100\" data-sal-duration=\"750\"> <img src=\"team.aba1e3c2.jpg\" alt=\"Zdjęcie pracujących ludzi\"> </div> </div> </section> <section class=\"tabs\" id=\"tabs\"> <div class=\"container tabs__container\"> <div class=\"tabs__svg\"> <svg width=\"219\" height=\"500\" viewbox=\"0 0 219 730\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <path d=\"M164.151 309.232H69.257C65.1256 309.232 61.7764 310.722 61.7764 312.561V336.509C61.7764 338.347 65.1256 339.837 69.257 339.837H164.151C168.282 339.837 171.632 338.347 171.632 336.509V312.561C171.632 310.722 168.282 309.232 164.151 309.232Z\" fill=\"#CF031C\"></path> <path d=\"M203.931 495.254C209.22 495.254 213.509 504.163 213.509 515.154C213.509 518.395 213.129 521.447 212.467 524.151C213.04 525.99 213.357 528.383 213.359 530.866C213.359 532.183 213.27 533.487 213.097 534.703C212.924 535.92 212.671 537.025 212.351 537.956C212.031 538.887 211.652 539.625 211.234 540.129C210.817 540.633 210.369 540.893 209.917 540.893C209.235 540.889 208.569 540.295 208.003 539.186C207.397 540.578 206.649 541.337 205.877 541.341C205.403 541.337 204.934 541.047 204.5 540.49C203.88 542.007 203.096 542.839 202.285 542.839C201.808 542.837 201.336 542.545 200.899 541.982C200.462 541.419 200.07 540.598 199.748 539.57C199.174 540.722 198.494 541.34 197.797 541.341C1