) 720px, 1512px\" alt=\"Przykład stylizacji paznokci\" width=\"1512\" height=\"2016\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full object-cover\"><img src=\"/_astro/zd17.DG7KcKL7_1ihDdf.webp\" key=\"15\" sizes=\"(max-width: 360px) 240px, (max-width: 720px) 540px, (max-width: 1600px) 720px, 1512px\" alt=\"Przykład stylizacji paznokci\" width=\"1512\" height=\"2016\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full object-cover\"></div></div></section> <astro-island uid=\"ZkSr45\" prefix=\"r2\" component-url=\"/_astro/Testimonials7.CF7ZCH9t.js\" component-export=\"Testimonial7\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.CwVaCARP.js\" props=\"{}\" ssr client=\"load\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Testimonial7&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}\" await-children><section data-sal=\"fade\" id=\"opinie\" class=\"overflow-hidden px-[5%] py-16 md:py-24 lg:py-28 bg-primary text-white\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden\" role=\"region\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\"><div class=\"relative\"><div><div class=\"flex ml-0 md:mx-3\"><div role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" class=\"min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 basis-full pl-0 md:basis-full md:px-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-lg flex-col items-center text-center\"><blockquote class=\"text-2xl font-dm md:text-2xl\">&quot;Jestem zachwycona efektem końcowym! Stylizacja paznokci była dokładnie taka, jaką sobie wymarzyłam.&quot;</blockquote><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center md:mt-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center\"><p class=\"font-semibold\">Anna</p><p>Zadowolony klient</p></div></div></div></div><div role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" class=\"min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 basis-full pl-0 md:basis-full md:px-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-lg flex-col items-center text-center\"><blockquote class=\"text-2xl font-dm md:text-2xl\">&quot;Uwielbiam zdobienia, które Patrycja tworzy na moich paznokciach. Każda wizyta to nowe, piękne wzory. Przedłużanie żelowe jest u niej perfekcyjne!&quot;</blockquote><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center md:mt-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center\"><p class=\"font-semibold\">Milena</p><p>Zadowolony klient</p></div></div></div></div><div role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" class=\"min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 basis-full pl-0 md:basis-full md:px-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-lg flex-col items-center text-center\"><blockquote class=\"text-2xl font-dm md:text-2xl\">&quot;Po ściągnięciu stylizacji i opracowaniu paznokci u Patrycji, moje dłonie wyglądają zdrowo i zadbane. Polecam każdemu, kto chce zadbać o swoje paznokcie!&quot;</blockquote><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center md:mt-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center\"><p class=\"font-semibold\">Katarzyna</p><p>Zadowolony klient</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><button class=\"focus-visible:ring-border-primary gap-3 items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap ring-offset-white transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 border border-border-primary text-text-primary absolute size-14 rounded-full bg-neutral-white left-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 mt-8 hidden md:flex md:size-14 border-none\" disabled=\"\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"size-6\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M12.707 17.293 8.414 13H18v-2H8.414l4.293-4.293-1.414-1.414L4.586 12l6.707 6.707z\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">Previous slide</span></button><button class=\"focus-visible:ring-border-primary gap-3 items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap ring-offset-white transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 border border-bo